  monsterId: 7c71c7c469b849e7bc68f09c174a426b
  displayName: Wyvern
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bcf89898f9158cc4aa2fd6bb6a369e96, type: 3}
  description: "Wyverns are lean, large dragonkin built for the sky: they have a
    barbed tail and two powerful wings that double as forelimbs when they clamber
    on the ground. Seen from afar, they\u2019re often mistaken for dragons, but their
    bodies are slimmer and their legs fewer. They move with quick, lunging hops when
    grounded, but prefer swooping strikes from above, announcing themselves with
    a piercing, predatory screech rather than a roar."
